#string STR_MODULE_ABSTRACT             #language en-US "Intel High Definition Audio controller driver"

#string STR_MODULE_DESCRIPTION          #language en-US "This driver follows the UEFI driver model and produces the EDK II Simple Audio Output Protocol on a child handle for each output of an Intel High Definition Audio controller."

